xnu 0377: trace the app's picture surface, not only the server's

Measured 2026-11-19: `0374`/`0375` trace the first fmt-0 surface of the boot,
which is backboardd's 1105 x 1160 tile, and the create line stops after 64
surfaces, so a surface the app creates later never appears. Before the
app-to-server transfer can be blamed, one boot has to say whether Photos creates
the 650 x 683 surface itself or the render server is the only creator.

Give `MobileSlideShow`/`Photos` its own three stack traces and 32 lock lines,
and raise the create-line cap to 4096. The filter is by process name, so the
window server's own budget is unchanged.

